  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Ordered evaluation and skip conditions",
      "items": [
        "The orchestrator reads media from the immutable submitted-version snapshot, then runs VLM extraction first. Media runs when an effective in-scope policy and extraction evidence exist; otherwise the task is skipped/recorded for review.",
        "Strategy runs after Media when its effective rubric is supported; it is independent and can still run if Media fails. Budget is a deterministic engine check after evaluation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Fail closed and retry",
      "items": [
        "Any unknown/invalid schema, timeout, model identity error, missing config, failed evidence or approval gate routes to Checker. AI review recommendations never reject a plan.",
        "An explicit OCR rule can return AI_AUTO_REJECTED only after authenticated Policy Owner sign-off on its exact revision/hash and only when every ordinary approval gate passes. Production has no signed rule, so this route is off.",
        "One eligible manual retry reuses the same immutable version/round snapshot; errors do not roll back submission."
      ]
    }
  ]
